'''David Beats Goliath''' (小よく犬を制す, ''Shō Yoku Inu o Seisu'', '''The Small Often Subdue Dogs''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Massive Damage Effect UP (M): The effect of this ability is increased by 20%.

