==Trivia==
*This [[Cat Combo|Combo]]'s Japanese name, Shō Yoku Inu o Seisu (小よく犬を制す, "The Small Often Subdue Dogs") is a pun on the idiom "Shō yoku dai o seisu" (小よく大を制す, "The small often subdue the large"), with the joke being that 大 ''dai'' (large) looks similar to 犬 ''inu'' (dog), and the cats defeat many canine enemies. Said idiom is itself based off of "[https://www.judo-ch.jp/dictionary/terms/juyoku/ Jū yoku gō wo seisu]" (柔よく剛を制す, "Softness often subdues hardness"), a translated passage from the ''[[wikipedia:Three Strategies of Huang Shigong|Three Strategies of Huang Shigong]]'' most commonly used in [[wikipedia:Judo|judo]] contexts, referring to how weaker but more flexible judoka can use their opponents' strength against them.

